OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790772498
OL,3,CMancini insists Man City is 'not
OL,4,Cguilty' of breaching Premier League
OL,5,Crules
OL,7,FFormer Man City Manager Roberto
OL,8,FMancini said the club is "not guilty"
OL,9,Fof breaching Premier League rules.
OL,11,FWhen asked about the financial
OL,12,Fcontroversy at a press conference in
OL,13,FTurkey on Sunday, Mancini told ITV
OL,14,FNews "Manchester City is not guilty."
OL,16,FHe said allegations of him holding a
OL,17,Fdouble contract while managing the
OL,18,Fclub "do not concern me, but concerns
OL,19,Fthem".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
