FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790772498
OL,3,CMancini insists Man City is 'not
OL,4,Cguilty' of breaching Premier League
OL,5,Crules
OL,7,FIt comes after the Man City faced a
OL,8,Fwave of criticism after the club was
OL,9,Ffound guilty of breaching more than
OL,10,F100 Premier League rules between 2009
OL,11,Fand 2018, which they strongly deny.
OL,13,FThey were accused of circumventing the
OL,14,Fleague's rules by taking funding from
OL,15,Ftheir owner, Sheikh Mansour, and
OL,16,Fdisguising it as sponsorship.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790772498
OL,3,CMancini insists Man City is 'not
OL,4,Cguilty' of breaching Premier League
OL,5,Crules
OL,7,FThis, it is alleged, enabled them to
OL,8,Finflate the revenues they were
OL,9,Freceiving and therefore spend more
OL,10,Fmoney on players to strengthen their
OL,11,Fsquad.
OL,13,FThe club was also accused of making
OL,14,Fadditional payments to the then
OL,15,Fmanager Roberto Mancini and City
OL,16,Fplayers off the club's books to
OL,17,Fdisguise costs, and of failing to co-
OL,18,Foperate with the Premier League's
OL,19,Finvestigation into these allegations,
OL,20,Fwhich began in 2018.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790772498
OL,3,CMancini insists Man City is 'not
OL,4,Cguilty' of breaching Premier League
OL,5,Crules
OL,7,FRoberto Mancini told ITV News he was
OL,8,Funbothered by these claims of a double
OL,9,Fcontract, which City strenuously
OL,10,Fdenied.
OL,12,FHe said: "No, it's not an issue that
OL,13,Fconcerns me. It's not a new thing
OL,14,Fbecause I think it's been coming up
OL,15,Fevery now and then for four, five
OL,16,Fyears."
OL,18,FThis is the first time Mancini has
OL,19,Fspoken about the claims, proclaiming
OL,20,FCity's innocence.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790772498
OL,3,CMancini insists Man City is 'not
OL,4,Cguilty' of breaching Premier League
OL,5,Crules
OL,7,FChairman Khaldoon Al Mubarak said his
OL,8,Fdetermination to prove they are not
OL,9,Fguilty remains "as strong as when this
OL,10,Fbegan" after the news was announced on
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,13,FAddressing the frustration surrounding
OL,14,Fthe lack of public detail, the
OL,15,Fchairman explained that legal
OL,16,Fconstraints prevent the club from
OL,17,Fdisclosing specific details.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790772498
OL,3,CMancini insists Man City is 'not
OL,4,Cguilty' of breaching Premier League
OL,5,Crules
OL,7,F"There are so many things that I would
OL,8,Flike to be able to share with you to
OL,9,Fhelp you understand why we feel so
OL,10,Fconfident in our position," Al Mubarak
OL,11,Fwrote.
OL,13,F"But the strict confidentiality of the
OL,14,Flegal process and our determination to
OL,15,Frespect it means I cannot do that at
OL,16,Fthe moment.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790772498
OL,3,CMancini insists Man City is 'not
OL,4,Cguilty' of breaching Premier League
OL,5,Crules
OL,7,F"We have faced challenges together
OL,8,Fbefore and have prevailed. There
OL,9,Fremain many who want to undermine the
OL,10,Fmomentum of our Club. We will not give
OL,11,Fthem that opportunity."
OL,13,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
